  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.org/dmi-framework#ContextIndicator">
    <rdfs:comment>Official series Z1–Z6 kept outside the composite; linked to a pillar only thematically (dmi:relatedPillar) and never reconstructed by imputation.</rdfs:comment>
